<p class="no-indent"><b>Virtuals:</b> <code>isCurrentlyDelayed</code>, <code>currentDelay</code>.<br>
<b>Indexes:</b> <code>orderedBy</code>, <code>status</code>, <code>paymentStatus</code>, <code>receivingMode</code>, <code>createdAt</code>, <code>orderedAt</code>, and the compound index <code>{status, orderedAt}</code>.</p>

<!-- ─────────────── D.8 ─────────────── -->
<h2>D.8&nbsp;&nbsp;Conversation Collection (<code>conversations</code>)</h2>
<p class="no-indent">Stores chat conversation threads between customers and administrators. Each order can have its own dedicated conversation for negotiation.</p>

<table>
<tr>
  <th style="width:20%">Field</th>
  <th style="width:15%">Data Type</th>
  <th style="width:10%">Required</th>
  <th style="width:10%">Default</th>
  <th style="width:45%">Description</th>
</tr>
<tr><td>_id</td><td>ObjectId</td><td>Auto</td><td>—</td><td>MongoDB primary key.</td></tr>
<tr><td>conversationId</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>—</td><td>CONV-XXXX, unique.</td></tr>
<tr><td>customerId</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>—</td><td>Reference to Customer.customerId.</td></tr>
<tr><td>customerName</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>—</td><td>Customer display name.</td></tr>
<tr><td>customerEmail</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>—</td><td>Customer email.</td></tr>
<tr><td>adminId</td><td>String</td><td>No</td><td>null</td><td>Assigned admin.</td></tr>
<tr><td>adminName</td><td>String</td><td>No</td><td>""</td><td>Admin display name.</td></tr>
<tr><td>subject</td><td>String</td><td>No</td><td>""</td><td>Conversation subject.</td></tr>
<tr><td>status</td><td>String (enum)</td><td>No</td><td>open</td><td>open, in_progress, resolved, closed.</td></tr>
<tr><td>customerUnreadCount</td><td>Number</td><td>No</td><td>0</td><td>Unread messages for customer.</td></tr>
<tr><td>adminUnreadCount</td><td>Number</td><td>No</td><td>0</td><td>Unread messages for admin.</td></tr>
<tr><td>lastMessage</td><td>String</td><td>No</td><td>""</td><td>Preview of the last message.</td></tr>
<tr><td>lastMessageAt</td><td>Date</td><td>No</td><td>now</td><td>Timestamp of the last message.</td></tr>
<tr><td>lastMessageBy</td><td>String (enum)</td><td>No</td><td>null</td><td>customer or admin.</td></tr>
<tr><td>orderId</td><td>String</td><td>No</td><td>—</td><td>Reference to Order.orderId.</td></tr>
<tr><td>createdAt</td><td>Date</td><td>Auto</td><td>now</td><td>Creation timestamp.</td></tr>
<tr><td>updatedAt</td><td>Date</td><td>Auto</td><td>now</td><td>Modification timestamp.</td></tr>
</table>

<p class="no-indent"><b>Indexes:</b> <code>conversationId</code>, <code>customerId</code>, <code>customerEmail</code>, <code>status</code>, <code>orderId</code>, <code>lastMessageAt</code>, <code>{customerId, status}</code>, <code>{adminId, status}</code>.</p>

<!-- ─────────────── D.9 ─────────────── -->
<h2>D.9&nbsp;&nbsp;Message Collection (<code>messages</code>)</h2>
<p class="no-indent">Stores all chat messages including text, quotes, payment requests, payment proofs, and delay notices.</p>

<table>
<tr>
  <th style="width:25%">Field</th>
  <th style="width:18%">Data Type</th>
  <th style="width:10%">Required</th>
  <th style="width:47%">Description</th>
</tr>
<tr><td>_id</td><td>ObjectId</td><td>Auto</td><td>MongoDB primary key.</td></tr>
<tr><td>messageId</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>MSG-XXXX, unique.</td></tr>
<tr><td>conversationId</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>Reference to Conversation.conversationId.</td></tr>
<tr><td>senderType</td><td>String (enum)</td><td>Yes</td><td>customer or admin.</td></tr>
<tr><td>senderId</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>Sender's identifier.</td></tr>
<tr><td>senderName</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>Sender's display name.</td></tr>
<tr><td>content</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>Text body of the message.</td></tr>
<tr><td>contentType</td><td>String (enum)</td><td>No</td><td>text, image, file, system, quote, payment-request, payment-proof, delay-notice.</td></tr>
<tr><td>quoteData</td><td>Subdoc</td><td>No</td><td>Negotiation quote payload (see D.9.1).</td></tr>
<tr><td>paymentRequestData</td><td>Subdoc</td><td>No</td><td>Payment request payload (see D.9.2).</td></tr>
<tr><td>paymentProofData</td><td>Subdoc</td><td>No</td><td>Payment proof payload (see D.9.3).</td></tr>
<tr><td>delayNoticeData</td><td>Subdoc</td><td>No</td><td>Delay notice payload (see D.9.4).</td></tr>
<tr><td>attachments</td><td>Array of Subdocs</td><td>No</td><td>name, size, type, path, url.</td></tr>
<tr><td>replyToMessageId</td><td>String</td><td>No</td><td>Reference to the message being replied to.</td></tr>
<tr><td>replyTo</td><td>Subdoc</td><td>No</td><td>messageId, content, sender.</td></tr>
<tr><td>isRead</td><td>Boolean</td><td>No</td><td>Whether the recipient has read it.</td></tr>
<tr><td>readAt</td><td>Date</td><td>No</td><td>Timestamp of read event.</td></tr>
<tr><td>isDeleted</td><td>Boolean</td><td>No</td><td>Soft-delete flag.</td></tr>
<tr><td>deletedFor</td><td>Array of String</td><td>No</td><td>Users the message was deleted for.</td></tr>
<tr><td>createdAt</td><td>Date</td><td>Auto</td><td>Creation timestamp.</td></tr>
</table>

