<h4>D.9.3&nbsp;&nbsp;<code>paymentProofData</code> Subdocument</h4>
<table>
<tr>
  <th style="width:22%">Field</th>
  <th style="width:18%">Data Type</th>
  <th style="width:60%">Description</th>
</tr>
