<tr><td>reviewedAt</td><td>Date</td><td>When it was reviewed.</td></tr>
<tr><td>reviewedBy</td><td>String</td><td>Reviewer name.</td></tr>
<tr><td>rejectionReason</td><td>String</td><td>Reason if rejected.</td></tr>
</table>

<h4>D.9.4&nbsp;&nbsp;<code>delayNoticeData</code> Subdocument</h4>
<table>
<tr>
  <th style="width:22%">Field</th>
  <th style="width:18%">Data Type</th>
  <th style="width:60%">Description</th>
</tr>
<tr><td>orderId</td><td>String</td><td>Reference to Order.orderId.</td></tr>
<tr><td>category</td><td>String</td><td>Delay category.</td></tr>
<tr><td>reason</td><td>String</td><td>Customer-facing reason.</td></tr>
<tr><td>originalExpectedDelivery</td><td>Date</td><td>Original ETA.</td></tr>
<tr><td>newExpectedDelivery</td><td>Date</td><td>New ETA.</td></tr>
<tr><td>reportedAt</td><td>Date</td><td>When it was reported.</td></tr>
</table>

<!-- ─────────────── D.10 ─────────────── -->
<h2>D.10&nbsp;&nbsp;Feedback Collection (<code>feedbacks</code>)</h2>
<p class="no-indent">Stores customer feedback and ratings after order completion.</p>

<table>
<tr>
  <th style="width:22%">Field</th>
  <th style="width:17%">Data Type</th>
  <th style="width:10%">Required</th>
  <th style="width:51%">Description</th>
</tr>
<tr><td>_id</td><td>ObjectId</td><td>Auto</td><td>MongoDB primary key.</td></tr>
<tr><td>feedbackId</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>FDBK-XXXX, unique.</td></tr>
<tr><td>orderId</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>Reference to Order.orderId.</td></tr>
<tr><td>customerId</td><td>ObjectId</td><td>Yes</td><td>Reference to Customer._id.</td></tr>
<tr><td>customerEmail</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>Denormalized email.</td></tr>
<tr><td>customerName</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>Customer name.</td></tr>
<tr><td>productId</td><td>String</td><td>No</td><td>Product identifier.</td></tr>
<tr><td>productName</td><td>String</td><td>No</td><td>Product name.</td></tr>
<tr><td>rating</td><td>Number</td><td>Yes</td><td>Overall rating 1–5 (whole number).</td></tr>
<tr><td>detailedRatings</td><td>Subdoc</td><td>No</td><td>See D.10.1.</td></tr>
<tr><td>title</td><td>String</td><td>No</td><td>Review title (max 100 chars).</td></tr>
<tr><td>comment</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>Review body (max 2000 chars).</td></tr>
<tr><td>pros</td><td>Array of String</td><td>No</td><td>Positive points.</td></tr>
<tr><td>cons</td><td>Array of String</td><td>No</td><td>Negative points.</td></tr>
<tr><td>wouldRecommend</td><td>Boolean</td><td>No</td><td>Recommend flag.</td></tr>
<tr><td>wouldPurchaseAgain</td><td>Boolean</td><td>No</td><td>Repurchase intent.</td></tr>
<tr><td>status</td><td>String (enum)</td><td>No</td><td>pending, approved, rejected, or featured.</td></tr>
<tr><td>adminResponse</td><td>Subdoc</td><td>No</td><td>message, respondedAt, respondedBy.</td></tr>
<tr><td>submittedAt</td><td>Date</td><td>Auto</td><td>Immutable submission timestamp.</td></tr>
<tr><td>updatedAt</td><td>Date</td><td>Auto</td><td>Modification timestamp.</td></tr>
<tr><td>isPublic</td><td>Boolean</td><td>No</td><td>Public visibility flag.</td></tr>
<tr><td>isVerified</td><td>Boolean</td><td>No</td><td>Verified flag.</td></tr>
<tr><td>helpfulCount</td><td>Number</td><td>No</td><td>Number of users who found it helpful.</td></tr>
</table>

<h4>D.10.1&nbsp;&nbsp;<code>detailedRatings</code> Subdocument</h4>
<table>
<tr>
  <th style="width:25%">Field</th>
  <th style="width:20%">Data Type</th>
  <th style="width:55%">Description</th>
</tr>
<tr><td>quality</td><td>Number</td><td>Quality rating (1–5 or null).</td></tr>
<tr><td>design</td><td>Number</td><td>Design rating (1–5 or null).</td></tr>
<tr><td>packaging</td><td>Number</td><td>Packaging rating (1–5 or null).</td></tr>
<tr><td>delivery</td><td>Number</td><td>Delivery rating (1–5 or null).</td></tr>
<tr><td>valueForMoney</td><td>Number</td><td>Value rating (1–5 or null).</td></tr>
<tr><td>customerService</td><td>Number</td><td>Service rating (1–5 or null).</td></tr>
</table>

<p class="no-indent"><b>Virtuals:</b> <code>overallRating</code>.<br>
<b>Statics:</b> <code>getAverageRating</code>, <code>getRatingDistribution</code>, <code>getRecentFeedback</code>.</p>

<!-- ─────────────── D.11 ─────────────── -->
<h2>D.11&nbsp;&nbsp;OTP Collection (<code>otps</code>)</h2>
<p class="no-indent">Stores one-time passwords used for email verification and password reset flows.</p>

<table>
<tr>
  <th style="width:20%">Field</th>
  <th style="width:18%">Data Type</th>
  <th style="width:12%">Required</th>
  <th style="width:50%">Description</th>
</tr>
<tr><td>_id</td><td>ObjectId</td><td>Auto</td><td>MongoDB primary key.</td></tr>
<tr><td>email</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>Target email, lowercased.</td></tr>
<tr><td>hashedOtp</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>Bcrypt hash of the 6-digit code.</td></tr>
<tr><td>expiresAt</td><td>Date</td><td>Yes</td><td>TTL index deletes the document at expiry.</td></tr>
<tr><td>attempts</td><td>Number</td><td>No</td><td>Failed-attempt counter (max 3).</td></tr>
<tr><td>createdAt</td><td>Date</td><td>Auto</td><td>Creation timestamp.</td></tr>
</table>

<p class="no-indent"><b>Indexes:</b> <code>{expiresAt: 1}</code> with <code>expireAfterSeconds: 0</code> (MongoDB TTL index), <code>{email: 1, createdAt: -1}</code>.</p>

<!-- ─────────────── D.12 ─────────────── -->
<h2>D.12&nbsp;&nbsp;BlacklistToken Collection (<code>blacklisttokens</code>)</h2>
<p class="no-indent">Stores invalidated JWT tokens from logout events so they cannot be reused before their natural expiry.</p>

<table>
<tr>
  <th style="width:20%">Field</th>
  <th style="width:18%">Data Type</th>
  <th style="width:12%">Required</th>
  <th style="width:50%">Description</th>
</tr>
<tr><td>_id</td><td>ObjectId</td><td>Auto</td><td>MongoDB primary key.</td></tr>
<tr><td>token</td><td>String</td><td>Yes</td><td>Logged-out JWT, unique.</td></tr>
<tr><td>expiresAt</td><td>Date</td><td>Yes</td><td>Original token expiry.</td></tr>
<tr><td>createdAt</td><td>Date</td><td>Auto</td><td>Creation timestamp.</td></tr>
<tr><td>updatedAt</td><td>Date</td><td>Auto</td><td>Modification timestamp.</td></tr>
</table>

<p class="no-indent"><b>Indexes:</b> <code>{expiresAt: 1}</code> with <code>expireAfterSeconds: 0</code> (MongoDB TTL index).</p>

<p style="text-align:center; margin-top:36pt; font-weight:bold;">— END OF APPENDIX D —</p>

</div>
</body>
</html>